# Dashboard App (`apps/dashboard`)

## Directory Structure

```
apps/dashboard/src/
  app/(dashboard)/        # authenticated routes
  app/(onboarding)/       # onboarding flow
  app/login/
  components/
    app/                  # feature-specific (prefixed dashboard-{feature}-{role})
    layout/               # page wrappers, nav, providers
    shared/               # truly reusable (empty-state, error-state, page-loader)
  shared/
    api/                  # orpc client, auth-client, session.server, query-keys, error-handler
    lib/
      organize/           # store.ts + controller.hook.ts (pipeline run state)
      pipeline/           # controller.hook.ts (stream, live-progress, runs, stats)
      playlists/          # store.ts + controller.hook.ts
      tracks/             # store.ts + controller.hook.ts
      clusters/           # store.ts + controller.hook.ts
      onboarding/         # store.ts + controller.hook.ts (sync stream)
  lib/
    utils.ts              # cn() only
    env.ts                # env re-export only
```

## Component Conventions

- File: `dashboard-{feature}-{role}.tsx` (kebab-case)
- Export: `PascalCase` matching the filename
- Always co-locate a skeleton: `export function DashboardXyzSkeleton() { ... }`
- Extract inline components out of page files into `components/app/`

## Data Fetching

- Server state: TanStack Query v5 via `orpc` client (`@/shared/api/orpc`)
- Use controller hooks from `@/shared/lib/{domain}/controller.hook` — they combine queries, mutations, and store access
- Invalidate via `queryKeys.*` from `@/shared/api/query-keys`
- Import `toastError` from `@/shared/api/error-handler` for copy-button error toasts

## Client State

- Per-domain Zustand stores in `shared/lib/{domain}/store.ts` — one store per domain, no cross-domain monolith
- Access via controller hooks; do not import domain stores directly in page files
- No `useState` for cross-component state — use the domain store via its controller

## Toast Conventions

- `toast.error()` for failures
- No `toast.success()` on pipeline launch (drawer opening is feedback enough)
- Error toasts always provide a "Copy" action for the error message

## Navigation

- Routes defined in `@harmonia/common/utils/routes` as `DASHBOARD_ROUTES`
- Use `Link` from `next/link` for all navigation — no `window.location.href` except hard redirects
